<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n88489" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσαιτ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ask besides,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδέν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					177.6
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἷμα π.</span>
			<i>demand more</i> blood, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				401
			</span></i> (anap.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. μισθόν</span>
			<i>demand higher</i> pay, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				1.3.21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>demand</i> or <i>require for</i> a purpose, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσους . . τὰ ἔργα προσαιτοίη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Vect.</u>
					4.39
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>ask as well as others</i> (sc. for a share), and so, c. acc.
			pers., <i>ask an alms of,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				7.83
			</span></i>, etc.: c. acc. rei, <i>beg for</i> a thing, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίοτον, στρατιάν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				791
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				1141
			</span></i>: c. dupl. acc., <i>beg</i> somewhat <i>of</i> one, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				512
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				7.3.31
			</span></i>: c. gen., <i>beg some of . . ,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				4
			</span></i>: abs., <i>to be importunate,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				64
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				429
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				452
			</span></i>; <i>to be a beggar,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				203b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				493.6
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.294a
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
